					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Way back in the way back, the idea that a group of artists could kill people with their paintings would have been pretty shocking. Nowadays, it's SOP. If this article could somehow be retrofitted and tied to the anart movement as an origin piece, it might have something going for it. But it's just a (fairly boring) painting that induces a very obvious effect on viewers.</p> 
				 	]]>
