					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-119273#post-1779871</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-119273/scp-151#post-1779871</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Tue, 21 May 2013 01:23:53 +0000</pubDate>
								<wikidot:authorUserId>1546201</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>It's a classic SCP reminiscent of the Creepypasta days, it manages to be just as interesting these days for most people and hasn't lost much of its luster over time, it's not up-to-standard of SCPs these days, but that's because this is one of the <strong>original</strong> SCPs, from simpler times, and deserves to be among its old companions as much as any other article on this site, (I personally <em>hate</em> <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-579">579</a> but in the eyes of many others it's a classic, so I don't question the reasoning behind it being on this site, the same could be said for this by you)</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-119273#post-1779862</guid>
