					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Could someone explain to me what seems to be the major attraction here?<br /> It just appears to me to be as simple as you look at it and it kills you for no obvious reason which I'm guessing is supposed to be hinted with the backstory but&#8230;<br /> The backstory doesn't seem to bring a lot to the table with it seeming to just say some artists died/vanished to make this. To me there isn't enough detail to really hook me on this.</p> 
				 	]]>
