					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Any attempts made to aspirate out the water in the lungs? Also, on a side note, you'd expect the difficulty breathing to be much more apparent while the subject is lying down (the same volume of fluid will cover much more surface area of the lung while you are lying down.) Just a bit of detail to really sell the symptoms.</p> 
