					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-119273#post-1523070</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-119273/scp-151#post-1523070</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Mon, 30 Jul 2012 21:23:32 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>September Burns</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1313339</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>What I like about this one is how it's not entirely complete. That is to say, we don't have all the information about this one. We don't know how it was created or how it got to be so horrifyingly dangerous. Reading the article, I get the sense that there's a story that hasn't yet been uncovered, which is an exciting feeling.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
