				<pubDate>Mon, 12 Jan 2009 18:01:15 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>snorlison</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>222125</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>To be a little pedantic, this wouldn't be classified as Keter. It's fairly easily contained, and seems as though it would easily destroyed. (Now, there may be serious repercusssions to destroying it, but it didn't seem like the Foundation knew of any such repercussions). Still with the ability to materialize water within subjects, it's definitely Euclid.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
